sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Supported credit reservation and settlement
  accDescr: A durable task reserves maximum cost against the original organization wallet. Settlement records actual usage and refunds unused credits once to the original organization. Eligible full refunds reference the original deduction.
  participant T as Supported task
  participant W as Original organization wallet
  participant L as Transaction ledger
  T->>W: Create durable resource and reserve maximum cost
  W->>L: Record original deduction and reference
  alt Actual usage finalized
    T->>W: Settle against original deduction
    W->>L: Record refund of unused difference once
  else Eligible full refund
    T->>W: Refund original deduction
    W->>L: Record original-linked refund once
  end
  L-->>T: Recorded financial outcome
